'''E. Honda''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 571
|rarity = UR
|name1 = E. Honda
|name2 = E. Honda CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''E. Honda CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
At first glance, E. Honda looks like a great tank unit. His resistance and knockback abilities are pretty useful, given that many angels are short-ranged pushers, and his knockback can impede them. Unfortunately, his range is too high for him to protect melee units, and despite having a relatively short cooldown, his health and damage aren't particularly high, not to mention his high speed forces your other units to catch up, leaving little opportunities for them to deal damage. The knockback ability can even cause them to miss their attacks.

What's more, he faces extreme competition from the more accessible [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]], who, despite being a meatshield, is a much better specialist with his disposability, as well as lower range, instead leaving your offense to any other attackers you may have.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Rusher}}

